# needs-native-review: the portal's next moves, My work's door to Quests, 27 Nov 2026
msgctxt "profile My work: the door to the Quests page, heading"
msgid "The village's quests"
msgstr "Las misiones de la aldea"

# needs-native-review: the portal's next moves, My work's door to Quests, 27 Nov 2026
msgctxt "profile My work: the door to Quests, for a member who holds a role"
msgid "Your roles carry your work. Quests are how others in the village chip in, and the board is there whenever you want one."
msgstr "Sus roles llevan su trabajo. Las misiones son la forma en que otras personas de la aldea aportan, y el tablero está ahí cuando quiera una."

# needs-native-review: the portal's next moves, My work's door to Quests, 27 Nov 2026
msgctxt "profile My work: the door to Quests, for a member with no role"
msgid "Quests are a way to take part, alone or with others. Find one that fits on the Quests page."
msgstr "Las misiones son una forma de participar, a solas o con otras personas. Encuentre una que le encaje en la página de Misiones."

# needs-native-review: the portal's next moves, My work's door to Quests, 27 Nov 2026
msgctxt "profile My work: the door to the village's Quests page"
msgid "Open Quests"
msgstr "Abrir Misiones"

# needs-native-review: the portal's next moves, Your quests, 27 Nov 2026
msgctxt "profile: quests the village consented to, the newest few"
msgid "Done"
msgstr "Hechas"

# needs-native-review: the portal's next moves, My roles one card per role, 27 Nov 2026
msgctxt "profile My roles: a role's part of the member's commitment, split"
msgid "Your part: {0}% of you, {1}% of what you give"
msgstr "Su parte: {0}% de usted, {1}% de lo que da"

# needs-native-review: the portal's next moves, My roles one card per role, 27 Nov 2026
msgctxt "profile My roles: a role's part of the member's commitment, not split"
msgid "Shares the {0}% you give with your other roles"
msgstr "Comparte con sus otros roles el {0}% que usted da"

# needs-native-review: the portal's next moves, My roles one card per role, 27 Nov 2026
msgctxt "profile My roles: the commitment of a member's only role"
msgid "You give it {0}% of yourself"
msgstr "Le da el {0}% de usted"

# needs-native-review: the portal's next moves, My roles one card per role, 27 Nov 2026
